==Skins==
{{Tabber
|Default
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:SkeletonKnight.png|200px]]
|Made entirely of white parts that resemble a skeletal humanoid.

Brown belt, black crown and a chestplate, which has a skull with neon blue eyes

Does not have a full torso, but instead has a partial ribcage.

Head is slightly smaller than most other enemies, and it has two large black eyeholes.

Wields a black sword with skulls that have neon blue eyes to attack enemies.
}}
|Mage
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:MageSkeletonKnight.png|200px]]
|Made out of brown wooden parts.

Has two neon green eyes and a neon green core in its torso.

Reinforced wooden torso.

Wields a wooden sword to attack enemies.
}}
|Fallen
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:FallenSkeletonKnight.png|200px]]
|Made entirely of black parts that resemble a skeletal humanoid.

Brown scarf, grey chestplate, armbands, crown with a blue crystal, plates around head, and spiked shoulder-pads, and blue horns.

Does not have a full torso, but instead has a partial ribcage.

Head is slightly smaller than most other enemies, and it has two large blue eyeholes.

Wields a grey sword with a blue crystal blade to attack enemies.
}}
|Duck
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:DuckSkeletonKnight.png|200px]]
|Small white duck with an orange beak and flippers.

Wears a grey band around its neck and a yellow strap around its torso.

Has two blades attached to its wings that it uses to attack enemies.
}}
|Creepy Santa
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:CreepySantaSkeletonKnight.png|200px]]
|White snowman with sticks as arms, red stone eyes and black buttons, carrot nose, black stone mouth and stick antlers.

Wields dual ice knives to attack enemies.
}}
}}

